                                "sense_id": "e6c5bc2d-53ba-3953-a023-c2324cc91c1c",
                                "text": "Switzerland is landlocked and obviously will never be a great sea power and must always trade overland.",
                                "translation": "瑞士是内陆国家，因此不会有很强的海军实力，只能进行陆地贸易。"
                            },
